  description: Fard dates are dark and rich. They have a deep, sweet flavour.
  origin: Oman and the UAE
  appearance: Dark brown to nearly black and glossy
  texture: Firm and a little chewy
  taste: Rich and sweet, like dark honey
  funFact: Fard dates keep well, which makes them great to store and share.
  benefits:
  - Natural energy boost
  - Good source of fibre
  nutritionNote: Like most dates, it has natural sugars for energy, plus fibre and
    minerals such as potassium.
  quizFeedback: Fard dates are dark, firm and richly sweet.
